# Wave 2 (Tilda, Juno, Piper): social action profiles and reactions, conversation topics and world reactions.
# Reactions are dialogues named social.<villager>.<action>.<outcome> (great for loved, good for liked, flop for disliked).

social tilda
  loves advice
  likes joke, compliment
  dislikes tease

social juno
  loves tease
  likes joke, compliment
  dislikes advice

social piper
  loves joke
  likes compliment, tease
  dislikes advice

# ---- Tilda ----
dialogue social.tilda.joke.good
n0 tilda: Ha! A joke with good margins. I'll put it on the slate.

dialogue social.tilda.joke.great
n0 tilda: Oh, that's a good one. I'm laughing in a shop. Don't tell anyone.
  expr happy
  emote note

dialogue social.tilda.joke.flop
n0 tilda: Hm? Was that a joke? ...Oh. Ha. I was counting change. Say it again, slower.
  emote question

dialogue social.tilda.compliment.good
n0 tilda: That's kind of you. I'll put it in the till, where it can grow.

dialogue social.tilda.compliment.great
n0 tilda: Oh, my. A compliment that size will need its own shelf. Thank you.
  expr happy
  emote heart

dialogue social.tilda.compliment.flop
n0 tilda: Oh. You're very kind. I'm not sure what to do with it. Where do I put it?
  emote sweat

dialogue social.tilda.advice.great
n0 tilda: Advice? Ask me anything. First: buy early. Second: pay in kindness. Third: wear a hat in March.
  expr happy
  emote note

dialogue social.tilda.advice.good
n0 tilda: My advice? Plant parsnips first. They pay for everything else.

dialogue social.tilda.advice.flop
n0 tilda: Advice from me? Dear, I sell seeds. I give directions, mostly. I'll try. Where to?
  emote sweat

dialogue social.tilda.tease.great
n0 tilda: Oh, you cheeky thing! I'll put that on the slate. Under "Brave."
  expr happy

dialogue social.tilda.tease.good
n0 tilda: Ha! Cheeky. A fair price for being fond of me.

dialogue social.tilda.tease.flop
n0 tilda: Teasing? In my shop? ...I'm choosing to take that as affection. Careful.
  emote sweat

# ---- Juno ----
dialogue social.juno.joke.good
n0 juno: Ha! Good one! Okay, okay, okay, I'm using that on Bram.

dialogue social.juno.joke.great
n0 juno: Oh, that's brilliant! I'm going to label it. "Joke (Excellent)."
  expr happy
  emote note

dialogue social.juno.joke.flop
n0 juno: Okay, okay, okay... Was that a joke? ...Oh! Ha. Sorry. The forge is loud.
  emote question

dialogue social.juno.compliment.good
n0 juno: Aw! Thanks! I'm blushing. It's the forge, probably. It's also you.

dialogue social.juno.compliment.great
n0 juno: Okay, okay, okay, I'm going to cry! It's soot! It's definitely soot. Thank you!
  expr happy
  emote heart

dialogue social.juno.compliment.flop
n0 juno: Oh! Er. Thank you. I wasn't ready. I'm holding a hammer. It's awkward.
  emote sweat

dialogue social.juno.advice.good
n0 juno: Advice? Okay! Sure. Here's mine: label everything. Twice.

dialogue social.juno.advice.great
n0 juno: Advice! I love advice! Okay, okay, okay: don't trust the red one. Always trust the hot one.
  expr happy

dialogue social.juno.advice.flop
n0 juno: Advice? Hm. I'd rather find out by burning myself. It's how I learned everything.
  emote sweat

dialogue social.juno.tease.great
n0 juno: Oh, you wicked thing! Do it again! I'll label it "Excellent Insult."
  expr happy
  emote note

dialogue social.juno.tease.good
n0 juno: Ha! Cheeky! I'll get you back with a very small, very sharp spoon.

dialogue social.juno.tease.flop
n0 juno: Okay, okay, okay... I'm not sure if that was funny. I'll decide later. Hm.
  emote ellipsis

# ---- Piper ----
dialogue social.piper.joke.good
n0 piper: Ha! Nice timing. You'd make a good drummer.

dialogue social.piper.joke.great
n0 piper: That's a chorus! Oh, I'm stealing it. I'll say I wrote it.
  expr happy
  emote note

dialogue social.piper.joke.flop
n0 piper: Wait, was that a joke? ...Oh! Ha. Sorry. I was tuning. Say it again, in B flat.
  emote question

dialogue social.piper.compliment.good
n0 piper: Aw, thanks! I'll hum it later. It's a lovely melody, as compliments go.

dialogue social.piper.compliment.great
n0 piper: Stop it, you'll make me modest! I can't be modest. It's off-brand.
  expr happy
  emote heart

dialogue social.piper.compliment.flop
n0 piper: Oh! Uh. Thank you. I'm not used to speeches without a drum roll.
  emote sweat

dialogue social.piper.advice.good
n0 piper: Advice? Sure. Never play a request in the key you were asked in. Keep them guessing.

dialogue social.piper.advice.great
n0 piper: Advice! Here: always tune before you panic. Panic's worse out of tune.
  expr happy

dialogue social.piper.advice.flop
n0 piper: Advice? Hm. I'd rather learn from a wrong note. It stays with you.
  emote sweat

dialogue social.piper.tease.great
n0 piper: Oh, that's a fine tease! I'll write it into the bridge.
  expr happy
  emote note

dialogue social.piper.tease.good
n0 piper: Ha! Cheeky. I'll answer in a very flat verse.

dialogue social.piper.tease.flop
n0 piper: Hm. Funny. I'll remember that during the encore.
  emote ellipsis

# ---- Topics ----
topic tilda.gossip
  npc tilda
  label Ask what the village is saying
  plays tilda.topic.gossip
  if hearts:tilda>=1
  priority 2
  cooldown 3

dialogue tilda.topic.gossip
n0 tilda: Pull up the stool. I never gossip. I just keep accurate books of what's said.
  emote note
  next n1
n1 tilda: {Wren's asking for lemons again.|Juno ordered three hundred rivets and a very small spoon.|Piper owes me four sonnets.|Marcus and Odalys are still not speaking over a pie.}
  tag funny
  next n2
n2 tilda: I'd say more, but the slate has ears.

topic tilda.slate
  npc tilda
  label Ask about the slate
  plays tilda.topic.slate
  if hearts:tilda>=3
  priority 3
  once

dialogue tilda.topic.slate
n0 tilda: The slate? Every small kindness in Wetherell, in chalk. It's an honor system. Mostly honor.
  next n1
n1 tilda: Yours is the best page. I won't tell you why. I'll just write more.
  expr happy
  emote heart
  tag wholesome

topic juno.labels
  npc juno
  label Ask about the labels
  plays juno.topic.labels
  if hearts:juno>=1
  priority 2
  cooldown 3

dialogue juno.topic.labels
n0 juno: Okay, okay, okay, the labels! Come look.
  emote sparkle
  next n1
n1 juno: {Tongs: "Not a Back Scratcher".|Bram's chair: "Do Not".|The bucket: "Swimming Pool (Official)".|The anvil: "Sulking, Possibly".}
  tag funny
  next n2
n2 juno: There's a new one every week. Bram pretends not to read them. He reads them.

topic juno.mark
  npc juno
  label Ask about her own mark
  plays juno.topic.mark
  if hearts:juno>=4
  priority 3
  once

dialogue juno.topic.mark
n0 juno: My own mark. A small stamp that's only mine. I haven't made it yet.
  next n1
n1 juno: Okay. Okay. When I do, you'll see it first. That's a promise, and I label my promises.
  expr happy
  emote heart
  tag wholesome

topic piper.request
  npc piper
  label Ask for a request
  plays piper.topic.request
  if hearts:piper>=1
  priority 2
  cooldown 3

dialogue piper.topic.request
n0 piper: A request! Finally. Let me guess: "something cheerful"?
  emote note
  next n1
n1 piper: {Here's a jig.|Here's a ballad. It's four minutes of sighing.|Here's the parsnip song.|Here's something I wrote this morning. It has a hiccup.}
  tag funny
  next n2
n2 piper: That's a chorus! Come back after the set. I'll take requests for the encore.

topic piper.silence
  npc piper
  label Ask about the quiet between songs
  plays piper.topic.silence
  if hearts:piper>=4
  priority 3
  once

dialogue piper.topic.silence
n0 piper: The quiet between songs? I used to fill it. With chatter, with puns, with panic.
  next n1
n1 piper: With you here, I let it sit. It's the best part of the set. Don't tell the fiddle.
  expr happy
  emote heart
  tag wholesome

# ---- World reactions (T-091): small remarks that wait for the player after something happens ----
reaction react.tilda.spring
on season:spring
npcs tilda
ttl 4
plays react.tilda.spring.d
say react.tilda.spring.d tilda: Seed season! The whole village will want parsnips on the same morning. I've cleared the counter and my nerves.

reaction react.tilda.fall
on season:fall
npcs tilda
ttl 4
plays react.tilda.fall.d
say react.tilda.fall.d tilda: Pie week. Everyone's arguing about crust, and everyone's wrong. I'm taking notes in chalk.

reaction react.tilda.harvest
on quest.done:tut_harvest
npcs tilda
ttl 5
plays react.tilda.harvest.d
say react.tilda.harvest.d tilda: First harvest! You grew something. In my window it goes. I'll put you on the slate for a pie.

reaction react.tilda.wren
on event:wren_heart4
npcs tilda
ttl 5
plays react.tilda.wren.d
say react.tilda.wren.d tilda: I hear Wren sang something terrible last night. Four people told me. I charged none of them for the gossip.

reaction react.juno.spring
on season:spring
npcs juno
ttl 4
plays react.juno.spring.d
say react.juno.spring.d juno: Okay, okay, okay, spring! Every gate in town fell off. I've labeled the pile "Opportunity".

reaction react.juno.summer
on season:summer
npcs juno
ttl 4
plays react.juno.summer.d
say react.juno.summer.d juno: The forge is a sauna with opinions. I stopped wearing sleeves. Bram's pretending not to see.

reaction react.juno.harvest
on quest.done:tut_harvest
npcs juno
ttl 5
plays react.juno.harvest.d
say react.juno.harvest.d juno: Your first harvest! Okay, okay, okay, tell me every detail. Especially the tools.

reaction react.juno.bram
on event:bram_heart4
npcs juno
ttl 5
plays react.juno.bram.d
say react.juno.bram.d juno: Bram said "Good enough. Better than good." about a repair. I'm having it carved on the anvil.

reaction react.piper.spring
on season:spring
npcs piper
ttl 4
plays react.piper.spring.d
say react.piper.spring.d piper: New season, new songs! Most are about parsnips. All are better than the last. It's a rule.

reaction react.piper.winter
on season:winter
npcs piper
ttl 4
plays react.piper.winter.d
say react.piper.winter.d piper: Winter ballads! Wool socks, slow bows, and everyone sits closer. It's my favorite acoustic.

reaction react.piper.harvest
on quest.done:tut_harvest
npcs piper
ttl 5
plays react.piper.harvest.d
say react.piper.harvest.d piper: You harvested something! I'm writing a verse. It rhymes "crop" with "stop". It almost works.

reaction react.piper.wren
on event:wren_heart10
npcs piper
ttl 5
plays react.piper.wren.d
say react.piper.wren.d piper: Wren's Opening Night! I heard it through three walls. I'm furious it was good.
